WEBVTT

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:13.870
Long, long ago,

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:17.700
a beautiful kingdom floated high in the sky.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.160
On its throne sat a round, noble, white cat,

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.830
and a muddy, black cat fell in love with her.

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:27.830
That was how it all began.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.480
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:01:58.090 --> 00:02:03.000
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:06.020
"Chapter 1: The Land Protected by Light"

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:11.540
The sky is groaning.

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:14.450
I refuse to surrender the Progenitor Rune!

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:36.910
There you are.

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:38.870
You look fully prepared.

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:39.750
I am.

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:42.080
Let's bring something home today!

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:45.200
I'd like to have some meat once in a while.

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:55.620
Up above the clouds, they can live
without a care in the world.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:57.910
What I wouldn't give for that life.

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:00.030
Hey! Monsters are coming!

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:00.410
What?!

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:03.620
Damn, so they've finally come here, too!

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:07.080
Take the kids and run!

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.000
There's a cave on that hill.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.660
Hide in there!

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:11.950
G-Got it!

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:14.160
If you can move, grab a weapon!

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.370
We haven't got time to be scared!

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:18.300
Let's go!

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:19.750
Okay.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:20.910
Take care of them!

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:23.080
We'll handle things here.

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:26.370
We'll try to bring down a big one
while we're at it.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.000
They're here!

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.290
Everybody! We're going to protect our village!

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:34.200
Yeah!

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:35.450
Come on!

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:48.910
Are you all right?

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:52.290
Y-Yeah. Thanks.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.540
We're almost there. Can you run?

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:04.120
Damn you!

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:13.250
Run to that hill!

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:14.410
Okay!

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:22.790
Watch out!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.250
Go.

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:32.750
Take care of my sister.

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:59.040
Hey!

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:00.870
Is anyone there?!

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:23.330
It must be up ahead.

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:25.790
I'll have a short rest.

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:31.450
What are you doing?

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:36.000
I was told that there's a village nearby.

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:38.950
It's gone.

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:40.540
Gone?

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:43.950
Then, what are you doing here?

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:45.500
Digging a hole.

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:46.620
A hole?

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:48.790
Is that wrong?

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:50.370
What is it for?

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:54.080
For the people killed by monsters.

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:58.370
What do you want?

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:00.000
Are you going to keep digging?

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.160
They got the neighboring villages, too.

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:07.950
Stop, boy.

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:10.620
You'll die for nothing at this rate.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:12.330
I don't plan to.

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:14.160
I'm getting enough sleep.

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:16.700
And food?

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:21.160
Eat.

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:29.080
Why give me this?

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:30.750
Don't be so wary.

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:32.160
It's just a whim.

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:41.910
My name is Skeers.

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:44.330
What's yours, boy?

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:46.080
Call me what you like.

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:48.120
Everyone else did.

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:49.540
I see.

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:51.870
Hey, mister.

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:55.540
Doesn't the King of Darkness rule this country?

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:57.120
He does.

00:06:57.120 --> 00:07:00.410
Then why does he let
dangerous monsters run wild?

00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:03.910
No doubt the king has his own concerns.

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:07.830
Is the king concerned about the right things?

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:10.830
What do you think the "right things" are?

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:14.040
Everyone being happy.

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:15.620
How superficial.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.870
That's why I'm digging a hole.

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:22.620
How long will you keep digging?

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.660
It's still too small.

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:28.870
How deep is deep enough?

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:32.330
Deep enough to reach the sky.

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:35.790
Fascinating. What do you mean?

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:38.080
I won't ask you to understand.

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:39.000
It's just...

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.290
Just what?

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:45.250
Sometimes, bright light shines
into the depths of the darkest holes.

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:47.910
I... like that.

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:51.910
It seems like even-handed kindness.

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:56.910
I see.

00:07:56.910 --> 00:08:00.120
There's no point obsessing over land and sky.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:02.870
Everyone's the same when you're in a hole.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:06.120
That's just... how it seems to me.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.660
Pick it up.

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:17.080
I'll teach you how to improve things
without digging holes.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:27.950
Huh?!

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:33.000
What's wrong?

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:34.450
We're not done yet.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:37.080
I didn't ask for this.

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:38.370
I suppose not.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:42.700
But why didn't you refuse to face me?

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:46.450
You're trying to tell me

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:50.830
to get strong enough to
protect people from monsters, right?

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:53.830
Who said anything like that?

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:54.910
Die.

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:57.540
If despairing and cursing the world
is all you can do,

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:00.120
your life has no value!

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:04.410
Well now.

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:06.330
What are you thinking?

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:09.160
If you want to kill me, why hold back?!

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:12.250
Just a whim.

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:16.040
You save or kill people on a whim?!

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:17.660
I do.

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:21.750
What gives you the right?!

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:23.950
Will you accept it if I tell you?

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:26.700
That right exists.

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:31.500
It belongs to someone
you could never even hope to meet.

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:33.450
That's the truth.

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.870
But what good will knowing the truth do you?

00:09:35.870 --> 00:09:37.910
Will you obey as long as there's a reason?

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:39.450
You mean the King of Darkness?!

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:40.750
Exactly.

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:43.950
To obey the King of Darkness
is the fate of the people of Black.

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:46.370
But you're not the king, are you?!

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:49.200
True.

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:51.540
I'm not the king,

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:56.870
I'm a fool who tried to become king
but wasn't chosen.

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:58.200
What's wrong?!

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:02.200
Are you the kind of person
who can be killed on a whim?!

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:05.950
Don't act so high and mighty!

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:08.370
Damn it!

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:16.540
No one can fault your ideals!

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:20.620
But making people happy isn't easy!

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:22.870
It takes more than half-hearted resolve!

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:25.080
I know that!

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:26.870
What will you do, then?!

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:28.540
Just dig holes forever

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:30.660
and wait for help from the sky?!

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:37.160
It's time you came to your senses!

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:39.790
Those who have glimpsed an ideal

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:44.410
have a duty to devote their lives
to making it a reality!

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:48.370
Then I'll do it!

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:52.160
I'll become king, or whatever it takes!

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:13.120
What?

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:14.540
I'm glad.

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:15.950
What for?

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:20.370
I never imagined such a miracle
would be waiting for me at the end.

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:22.250
This isn't over yet.

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:24.370
No, time is up.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:26.540
For me.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.580
H-Hey, mister!

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:33.410
I fought the current King of Darkness
over the succession.

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:36.040
Of course I'm old.

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:42.750
Boy, take this sword and go to the capital.

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:44.750
I have a mansion there.

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:46.700
I may not look it, but I'm from a noble family.

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:50.250
The one who bears that sword
is considered its head.

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:52.870
Then, declare yourself.

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:58.790
Declare that you are the Prince of Darkness,
successor to the King of Darkness!

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:01.080
There's a knight called Vallus.

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:02.870
He is just.

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:07.330
If he sees your skill with a sword,
he'll look after you.

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:11.290
Earn his recognition,
and he will be true to you.

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:13.540
I never said I'd go.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:17.450
You're supposed to nod,
boy who reminds me of myself.

00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:19.830
Me, like you?

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:21.250
You've gotta be kidding.

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:24.580
Watch your language.

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:27.950
I trust you can do that much.

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:31.620
I felt it, too, you know.

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:36.410
Rest, not just in darkness,
but in light as well.

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:40.200
Mister... Skeers,

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:43.290
are you really done for?

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:47.040
I've been an empty shell for a long time.

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:51.950
I'm no longer being supplied with
the Power of Darkness.

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:53.200
Please, boy.

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:56.160
The world is not right as things stand.

00:12:56.160 --> 00:13:00.200
Change it... in your reign!

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:01.660
I will.

00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:11.160
He was born in Black, but that light...!

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:14.580
Is it coming... from me?

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:18.580
I'm counting on you.

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:23.250
Skeers.

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:27.750
All right.

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:32.580
I'll start by becoming the King of
Darkness's successor, like you said!

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:35.830
Once I do that, I'll be able to do it, right?

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:39.830
Make everyone in the world happy?

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:45.970
"No. 01 The Two Worlds"
"White in the sky, Black on earth."
"They are shaped like an hourglass; they could
be reversed, and it would make little difference.
These two kingdoms form
the whole world of Zero Chronicle."

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:51.330
Rune, obey my will!

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:55.410
Calida Lux, Puram Lucem!

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:57.950
Darkness, begone!

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:14.500
There are still so many!

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.700
Defend the queen!

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:20.080
Knights of Light, do not lose courage!

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:21.290
Phious!

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.540
The Rune's protection is with us!

00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:28.370
Do not let monsters of darkness
sully the Kingdom of White!

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:32.450
Support them!

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:33.620
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:37.000
Rune that the priestess commands,

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:41.120
lend us a fraction of your power.

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:44.540
Light, become a shield and repel evil!

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:52.080
Thanks, Sheama!

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.660
Don't miss this chance!

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:56.120
Rout them!

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:02.450
As I thought, it's expanding.

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:05.500
The balance won't hold at this rate.

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:14.330
Her Majesty has returned.

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:16.950
She drove off the darkness.

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:32.660
Oh, Phious!

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:36.450
I'm back, Theo.

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:42.620
Now then, let's all rest
in preparation for the next attack.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:45.290
I'll inform you if anything happens.

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.370
Yes, ma'am!

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:48.450
May the Progenitor Rune protect you.

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:52.950
Welcome back, Sheama.

00:15:53.910 --> 00:15:55.500
Thank you.

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:58.620
How was your work?

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:00.370
Are you hurt?

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:03.080
Don't underestimate the leader
of the Knights of Light.

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:05.200
Darkness will never get the better of me.

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:06.910
That's my big brother!

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:10.830
Aren't you forgetting my support magic, Phious?

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:13.750
Support magic? Are you sure?

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:18.830
Well now! I could swear
I heard you say, "Thanks, Sheama!"

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:20.250
Just kidding.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:25.290
You realize the knights aren't
the only ones fighting the darkness?

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:29.950
We mages are putting our lives on the line, too.

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:33.330
Yes, and so is Her Majesty.

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:42.580
With the Progenitor Rune's power, she might be
able to defeat even the King of Darkness.

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:46.040
But she can't afford to use up all her power.

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:52.910
You receive the Rune's protection
through your tiara, don't you, Sheama?

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:55.080
That's true.

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:59.040
Still, I wonder...

00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:01.290
Darkness is essential to the balance.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:04.000
Could that be causing her to hesitate?

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:08.370
Her Majesty is wholly dedicated to
vanquishing the King of Darkness.

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:10.250
I hope so.

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:13.160
Sheama, this is just between us.

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:17.950
I know you, so I don't mind,
but you shouldn't say such things.

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:20.040
I understand.

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:24.290
I <i>am</i> the court mage and a commander.

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:32.330
Your Majesty.

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:36.500
Queen Iris, are you well?!

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:37.700
What?

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:40.120
You didn't use too much power?

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:43.580
No. You needn't worry.

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:45.370
How many times does this make?

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:49.330
We managed to repel the
darkness's invasion with difficulty,

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:52.250
but it may not go so well next time.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:55.330
Then, the darkness really is...

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:57.120
The King of Darkness.

00:17:57.120 --> 00:18:01.910
That embodiment of instinct is
growing ever more concentrated.

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:06.000
Who can say how long my power
will work against him.

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:12.370
I'm sorry, but we need even more
military preparation and training.

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:13.580
Yes, Majesty.

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:22.290
You there.

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:25.330
Where did you get that sword?

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:28.410
Do I have to tell you?

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:31.620
I heard Skeers's mansion is in this city.

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:33.620
Do you know where it is?

00:18:33.620 --> 00:18:36.370
Mind your manners, thief!

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:40.870
I demand that you return my lord's pride!

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:46.830
Hey, are you Vallus?!

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:49.620
How do you know my name?

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:51.580
Where is Lord Skeers?

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:52.910
He's dead.

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:56.750
Did you kill him?!

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:06.950
No, one such as you could never
so much as scratch him.

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:10.870
Why did you come here?

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:13.450
Those who have glimpsed an ideal

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:18.200
have a duty to devote their lives
to making it a reality!

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:22.540
You say that while groveling in the dirt?

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:24.950
What's wrong with groveling?!

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:30.620
I am the Prince of Darkness,
successor to the King of Darkness!

00:19:33.910 --> 00:19:37.410
I shall acknowledge you as my lord.

00:19:38.620 --> 00:19:40.830
I shall guide you to the manor.

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:42.120
This way.

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:52.160
Progenitor Rune,

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:54.620
give us your protection.

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:56.540
When I see you like that,

00:19:56.540 --> 00:20:00.950
the title "White Priestess" seems
more fitting than "Queen of Light."

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:05.200
Can't you sleep, Your Majesty?

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:07.620
Please don't stand on ceremony.

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:12.160
You're like an older sister to me, Sheama.

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:14.250
We've been together a long time.

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:17.450
We trained together to become
the successor to the throne.

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:20.200
And you won.

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:21.790
Sheama.

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:23.870
I'm not bitter.

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:25.950
You couldn't help it.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.120
Say, do you remember?

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.000
What?

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.660
The previous Queen of Light.

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:34.040
I don't.

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:35.700
It's strange.

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:40.790
I remember that she was here
before you took the throne,

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:43.580
but I can't remember any details.

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:48.250
Just that she always had
a peaceful look on her face.

00:20:48.250 --> 00:20:51.700
Somehow, I understand.

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:56.160
Accumulation isn't necessary
to maintain balance.

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:59.200
You just have to always
remain in the same state.

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:01.540
Does the Progenitor Rune tell you that?

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:03.330
I suppose so.

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:04.950
Still,

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:08.700
the forces of darkness have
been steadily growing in power.

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:12.290
Is their entire country
after the Progenitor Rune?

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:14.870
No, that isn't it.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:17.540
The Kingdom of Black's people are no different.

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:21.750
It's just that their king has gone out of
control and is dragging them to ruin.

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:24.200
I wonder.

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:29.870
I'm sure that under the next King of Darkness,
the balance will be preserved once more.

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:34.080
You may have been forgotten by then, you know?

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:40.450
Maybe no one will even remember that you
repelled the King of Darkness so many times.

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:44.870
As long as the future is peaceful, I don't mind.

00:21:44.870 --> 00:21:45.830
I see.

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:47.160
Goody two shoes.

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:48.370
I'm not--

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:50.160
Pardon me!

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:51.410
What's wrong?

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:54.000
The western capital is under attack.

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:55.750
It's Bahl.

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:56.790
Bahl!

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:58.250
Your Majesty!

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:00.000
We'll set out at once!

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:02.790
Sheama! You and Phious ready the troops!

00:22:02.790 --> 00:22:03.790
Yes, Majesty!

00:23:43.270 --> 00:23:46.940
"Next Time"
"Chapter 2: The World's Egoism"
